bat solutions, such as wheeled and tracked combat vehicles, Stryker wheeled combat vehicles, piranha vehicles, weapons systems, energetics and munitions, mobile bridge systems with payloads, tactical vehicles, main battle tanks, and armored vehicles; and offers modernization programs, support and sustainment services, and development programs. The Technologies segment provides information technology solutions and mission support services; mobile communication, computers, and command-and-control mission systems; intelligence, surveillance, and reconnaissance solutions to military, intelligence, and federal civilian customers; cloud services, cybersecurity, network modernization, artificial intelligence; machine learning; application development, high-performance computing, and 5G and advanced communications services; and unmanned undersea vehicle manufacturing and assembly services. The company was founded in 1899 and is headquartered in Reston, Virginia.","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","sector":"Industrials","marketCap":91145789440,"trailingPE":21.197485,"forwardPE":18.573874,"pegRatio":2.58,"priceToBook":3.4897134,"priceToSales":1.6939077,"profitMargin":8.068,"operatingMargin":10.541,"grossMargin":15.241,"returnOnEquity":17.974001,"returnOnAssets":6.005,"revenueGrowthYoy":10.299999999999999,"earningsGrowthYoy":12,"earningsQuarterlyGrowthYoy":13.200000000000001,"debtToEquity":37.701,"currentRatio":1.384,"quickRatio":0.795,"freeCashFlow":5289500160,"operatingCashFlow":7411999744,"totalCash":3654000128,"totalDebt":9831999488,"revenue":53808001024,"dividendYield":1.7999999999999998,"payoutRatio":38.33,"beta":0.345,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":369.7,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":268.1,"targetMeanPrice":392.21524,"targetHighPrice":444,"targetLowPrice":313,"recommendationKey":"buy","numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"lastQuarter":{"date":"2026-03-31","period":"-1q","epsActual":4.1,"epsEstimate":3.69302,"surprisePct":11.020000000000001},"earningsHistory":[{"date":"2025-06-30","period":"-4q","epsAct